    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/cce6d58d1ece363398b128b841ae2873.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/cce6d58d1ece363398b128b841ae2873.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/cce6d58d1ece363398b128b841ae2873.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/a7f42708535b86e3d27bceffe51fe36b.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/a7f42708535b86e3d27bceffe51fe36b.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/a7f42708535b86e3d27bceffe51fe36b.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deck RX</strong> is a roguelite game mixing two very different classic genres: <strong>racing and turn-based card games</strong>. In <strong>Deck RX</strong>, you will perform all your actions in the game by using<strong> cards</strong> that act as actions and abilities. Speeding up, braking, drifting\u2026 and of course, <strong>you may also combat against your opponents!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/f2d144c934dfe37014fd7d73e2e662e4.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/f2d144c934dfe37014fd7d73e2e662e4.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/f2d144c934dfe37014fd7d73e2e662e4.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Choose your own strategy You can achieve victory in <strong>two ways</strong>: by being the fastest to reach the finish line, or by destroying others so they <strong>NEVER</strong> reach it! Customize your deck to fit your playstyle. You will have access to many cards and enhancements of different styles, power and rarity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/6dc2c9bc2b4a7effbbb2488bc58fbd4b.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/6dc2c9bc2b4a7effbbb2488bc58fbd4b.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/6dc2c9bc2b4a7effbbb2488bc58fbd4b.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Visual style<strong> </strong>Based on 90's sci-fi that takes references from anime, cyberpunk style and retro video games we used to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/135c73c015844a0806ee2b8339cff353.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/135c73c015844a0806ee2b8339cff353.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/135c73c015844a0806ee2b8339cff353.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Progression</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Through the game you will fight boss characters and beat character-specific challenges to <strong>unlock new pilots, worlds, cards and enhancements</strong> for your car\u2019s inventory, as well as cosmetics to customize your journey further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/693601482f8e7e4231242d82979e74f4.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/693601482f8e7e4231242d82979e74f4.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/693601482f8e7e4231242d82979e74f4.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deck RX includes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>150+</strong> cards to interact with the game\u2019s racetracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>50+</strong> enhancements that can be used to customize car, dramatically altering certain aspects of the race</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>8 characters</strong> (and more to be developed): humans, cyborgs and strange aliens, each with their own stats, and specific exclusive cards and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 different worlds</strong>, each with its own theming and special mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15-20 hand-crafted tracks per world</strong>, of which you will only see a few per run, ensuring great replayability without compromising on level design.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/d8eef261689ba50b6e01ab6d239e9ecd.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/d8eef261689ba50b6e01ab6d239e9ecd.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/d8eef261689ba50b6e01ab6d239e9ecd.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh yes, and we also have <strong>Bert</strong>, the super-helpful shopkeeper who will assist you in <strong>building your deck!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/ee1f7b5813ff7a87f2112298ed523690.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/ee1f7b5813ff7a87f2112298ed523690.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/ee1f7b5813ff7a87f2112298ed523690.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
