s=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/d8eef261689ba50b6e01ab6d239e9ecd.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/d8eef261689ba50b6e01ab6d239e9ecd.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/d8eef261689ba50b6e01ab6d239e9ecd.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh yes, and we also have <strong>Bert</strong>, the super-helpful shopkeeper who will assist you in <strong>building your deck!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/ee1f7b5813ff7a87f2112298ed523690.poster.avif?t=1726814588\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/ee1f7b5813ff7a87f2112298ed523690.webm?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1529180/extras/ee1f7b5813ff7a87f2112298ed523690.mp4?t=1726814588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
